# input/ is read FIRST, before the walk begins. Any file here can pre-set where
# the walk starts. Uncomment (remove the leading #) a line to activate it; lines
# starting with # are ignored by the reader.
#
# mode=chronological      # chronological | similar | different
# field=created           # created | modified
# direction=asc           # asc (oldest first) | desc (newest first)
#
# As shipped, every line is commented, so this file changes nothing. Copy it,
# uncomment, and the next `./run.sh` starts already pointed the way you want.
